# The repo root ignores *.png and *.pdf globally (.gitignore:91-92), which would
# silently drop the FSU lockups the title slide and footer bar load -- a checkout
# would then fail to compile. A negation in a deeper .gitignore takes precedence.
# Same trap the parent study's .gitignore documents for figures/.
!logos/
!logos/*.png

# The built deck is a regenerable artefact: `typst compile --root .. model_size.typ`.
model_size.pdf
